OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Racism can crush you, but I used
OL,4,Ait for motivation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardner was Wolves' first Black senior
OL,7,Fplayer, Hazell its first Black
OL,8,Fgoalscorer, while Berry was the first
OL,9,FBlack player to lift a trophy for the
OL,10,Fclub.
OL,12,F"If you're the only Black face on the
OL,13,Fpitch and thousands of people are
OL,14,Fshouting abuse, that's hard," recalled
OL,15,FBerry.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
